  "name": "CritterConDiego",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "CritterConDiego was a mini furry convention held in San Diego, California, from 2000 to 2002 on the same summer weekends as Comic-Con International. It was managed by the ConFurence Group, which scheduled events in the evening after the Comic-Con dealer rooms closed and promoted them as an \"Anthro Arts Relaxacon\". The organizers were not affiliated with Comic-Con and welcomed furry fans who were not attending it. Membership and dealer tables were modestly priced, and fursuiters were admitted free. After ConFurence ended in 2003, Califur organized similar evening events at Comic-Con under the name Califur Diego.",
